ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/566650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative","html_url":"https://github.com/impredicative","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/impredicative/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T18:36:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T18:38:04Z","body":"@justschen I switch between modes as needed. Here is an approximate timeline of events:\n\n1. I use Edit mode to make edits which I Keep.\n2. I manually make code edits.\n3. I use Ask mode to chat.\n4. I loop the above two steps.\n5. I delete the Ask mode chat messages (starting with event 3) because I want to shorten the context, so I can continue in Edit mode. I do this by X ing out the message in event 3.\n6. Immediately upon deleting my Ask mode messages, my manually made code edits disappear!\n\nSuch a timeline should be easy to reproduce.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2956617948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3018279868","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11876#issuecomment-3018279868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11876","id":3018279868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6z50u8","user":{"login":"palash-sarate","id":99325824,"node_id":"U_kgDOBeuXgA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99325824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate","html_url":"https://github.com/palash-sarate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palash-sarate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T08:35:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T08:35:07Z","body":"This happening with me too. I agree that copilot should not touch my code at all when using ask mode. This is serious issue as one can't pinpoint the changes that were deleted wrongfully by copilot.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3018279868/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3173016679","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11876#issuecomment-3173016679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micro